    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let a soft, squishy <strong>Eggo</strong> move into your screen~ (\u1422\uff61\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0\u032b\u00a0\u2022\uff61\u1422) In &quot;Eggo&quot;, a cute little Eggo quietly stays by your side as you study or work, making every day feel extra special! Every <i>tap-tap</i> of your keyboard pushes it to search even harder for treasures across different planets. You\u2019ll raise your Eggo from the very beginning \u2014 hatching from its shell, growing up, exploring, and even falling in love and starting a family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/922df9962e6d03ab1db7b6a7e5a1abad.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/922df9962e6d03ab1db7b6a7e5a1abad.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/922df9962e6d03ab1db7b6a7e5a1abad.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/bb13a94f33875764d26393ebe86bcc57.avif?t=1754620769\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by adopting an Eggo egg with your friend! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/0ed70c616cd1283e3cdf711b56d1e6c1.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=740 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/0ed70c616cd1283e3cdf711b56d1e6c1.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/0ed70c616cd1283e3cdf711b56d1e6c1.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the egg crack open, bit by bit, until your tiny Eggo finally hatches into the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment on, this cute egg is all yours~ Feed it, care for it, and become its one and only family (and eggoaholic)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/12bd0eaaadbe1d5a3d82a28508ffd8b7.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/12bd0eaaadbe1d5a3d82a28508ffd8b7.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/12bd0eaaadbe1d5a3d82a28508ffd8b7.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/56421d2eacfd7c4113369056afcfd663.avif?t=1754620769\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With your love and care, your Eggo will grow from a soft little puff into a mini adventurer, collecting cute space goodies without leaving your screen corner! You can exchange those treasures for shiny coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/c5904a58bbfadf1c1acb23b88355d675.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/c5904a58bbfadf1c1acb23b88355d675.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/c5904a58bbfadf1c1acb23b88355d675.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend those coins to buy your Eggo new goodies \u2014 adorable outfits, cozy furniture...Make Eggo\u2019s home your dream space!Seeing your Eggo happily living in its cute little home is the best feeling ever~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f017598ee495c45f3fe87a19aed5f77d.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f017598ee495c45f3fe87a19aed5f77d.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/f017598ee495c45f3fe87a19aed5f77d.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/459aabfd3c1e666328c33d882529adfc.avif?t=1754620769\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even find the perfect match for your Eggo! Chat with your friends like proud parents and arrange the cutest little marriage between your Eggos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/06add0b3152fa84341b97ce4d18a6fb5.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/06add0b3152fa84341b97ce4d18a6fb5.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/06add0b3152fa84341b97ce4d18a6fb5.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two Eggos truly fall for each other, a brand-new Eggo egg will be born~ Whose traits will the baby Eggo inherit? Mom\u2019s? Dad\u2019s? Or maybe even a super rare hidden gene?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come to witness the joy of this adorable new life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/e96d31f5cb88338c024cd65ecb7abf47.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/e96d31f5cb88338c024cd65ecb7abf47.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/e96d31f5cb88338c024cd65ecb7abf47.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let a soft, squishy <strong>Eggo</strong> move into your screen~ (\u1422\uff61\u2022\u00a0 \u00a0\u032b\u00a0\u2022\uff61\u1422) In &quot;Eggo&quot;, a cute little Eggo quietly stays by your side as you study or work, making every day feel extra special! Every <i>tap-tap</i> of your keyboard pushes it to search even harder for treasures across different planets. You\u2019ll raise your Eggo from the very beginning \u2014 hatching from its shell, growing up, exploring, and even falling in love and starting a family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/922df9962e6d03ab1db7b6a7e5a1abad.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/922df9962e6d03ab1db7b6a7e5a1abad.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/922df9962e6d03ab1db7b6a7e5a1abad.mp4?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/bb13a94f33875764d26393ebe86bcc57.avif?t=1754620769\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start by adopting an Eggo egg with your friend! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/0ed70c616cd1283e3cdf711b56d1e6c1.poster.avif?t=1754620769\" width=740 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700760/extras/0ed70c616cd1283e3cdf711b56d1e6c1.webm?t=1754620769\" type=\"video/webm; c